pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 36, 400, 16]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: LIVE ON DSH}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 56, 848, 36]
    content: {style: "$pageTitle", wrap: false, text: 已跑通：skill 注入 dsh，引擎实测就绪}
  - elementId: title-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 102, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: check-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 124, 400, 22]
    content: {fontSize: 15, color: "$ink", bold: true, wrap: false, text: 本机实测清单（2026-08-14）}
  - elementId: checks
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 154, 420, 240]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>✓</strong></span> 引擎就绪：<span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono; font-size:11.5px;">aihf 2.2.0</span>（pipx 隔离安装）</p>
        <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>✓</strong></span> 三份 mandate 全部通过解析校验</p>
        <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>✓</strong></span> 缺 key 时错误路径清晰，不静默失败</p>
        <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>✓</strong></span> dsh <span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono; font-size:11.5px;">skill.list</span> 已出现 <span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono; font-size:11.5px; color:$primary;">alpha-desk</span></p>
        <p>　（<span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono; font-size:11px;">modelInvocable: true</span>，模型可自主调用）</p>
        <p><span style="color:$primary;"><strong>✓</strong></span> DeepSeek 推理切换验证：<span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono; font-size:11px;">--model deepseek-v4-pro</span></p>
  - elementId: left-note-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 414, 420, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: left-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 428, 420, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$body"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>右图为 dsh Web 实操界面（本机 127.0.0.1:3080）：</p>
        <p>skill 在会话内被注入、工具调用全程可视化——</p>
        <p>投研过程的每一步都可回放、可审计。</p>
  - elementId: shot
    elementType: image
    bounds: [500, 124, 404, 253]
    src: media/dsh-agent-running.png
    fit: {mode: cover}
    crop: {top: 0.02, bottom: 0.02}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: shot-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [500, 384, 404, 16]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [center, middle], wrap: false, text: "deepseek-harness Web 实操界面（真实截图）"}
  - elementId: cmd-panel
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [500, 412, 404, 76]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$faint"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: cmd
    elementType: text
    bounds: [514, 420, 380, 60]
    content:
      style: "$code"
      fontSize: 10
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:$muted;"># 一句话触发完整投研周期</span></p>
        <p>$ aihf mandates/deep-value-weekly.yaml \</p>
        <p>    --tickers AAPL,MSFT,NVDA --backtest \</p>
        <p>    --model deepseek-v4-pro --out records/b1.json</p>
  - elementId: pagenum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 512, 34, 14]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: "07"}
